{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は暑かったな〜\n衣替え、、今度でもいいか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この繰り返し。\nでも今度ね、みーぱんとめいが私の部屋を片付けしにきてくれるらしい。私この言葉間に受けてる。2人が来てくれるまで片付けないで待ってよーっと☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美です🦒\nくみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4FA69VXAMWGKY7R63C6Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4GEVQXK9RWW7SVWT24VS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n少し前のリアルミーグリの時\nみぱーんと写メ🤳🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィン近かったからコスプレしている子達たくさんいて可愛かったな〜リアルミーグリってなかなか会える機会がない中での特別な機会だからお洋服迷っちゃって、でも着ようと思ってた服が届かなくて、前日に届いたいつか大事に着ようと思っていたお洋服を着ました🥼計画性のない持ち主のせいで早めの出番にびっくりしたことでしょう。ボーダーくん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4HK1R9ZP9KBVN7YQ89H1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4JRADPZ3WKFP58A7S5J6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4KS1FSHT2Q3DZRJ81ZQG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4MY0R32NR966PC4P5D09","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4P23GRA1VBJGGYQNTA7F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4Q7EKBX6PA43Z17CSWTT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ6W4RBAA7P9WSBN1FNNYZMQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nお花もいっぱいありがとう愛\n愛でいっぱいなこの空間が大好きだよーー🌹\nまた会おうね( ◠‿◠ )♥️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"